  "details": "1. Get invited to a group\n\n2. View the group from the notification\n\n3. Block the group from the button on the group page (NOT from the notification)\n\n4. The notification is now partially stuck there - it can ONLY be dismissed via the dismiss notification button, the accept/deny/block buttons on the notif itself do nothing\n\nIdeally blocking the source of an invite would delete the notif, but at the very least the deny button should still work in this scenario.",
